      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:33.221372Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "3.2 Lifespan",
      "source_hash": 4533624695293627840,
      "context_hash": 18274549610932283136,
      "translation": "3.2 수명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:33.221372Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "3.2 will receive bugfix updates approximately every 4-6 months for approximately 18 months.",
      "source_hash": 1794042707388135,
      "context_hash": 14523337135156702688,
      "translation": "3.2에는 약 18개월 동안 약 4~6개월마다 버그 수정 업데이트가 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:33.221372Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "After the release of 3.3.0 final (see PEP 398), a final 3.2 bugfix update will be released.",
      "source_hash": 15777577421069496241,
      "context_hash": 18030342289630229086,
      "translation": "3.3.0 최종 버전이 릴리스된 후(PEP 398 참조), 최종 3.2 버그 수정 업데이트가 릴리스됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:33.221373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "After that, security updates (source only) will be released until 5 years after the release of 3.2 final, which was planned for February 2016.",
      "source_hash": 13856403530147980205,
      "context_hash": 4070303258395055560,
      "translation": "그 후에는 3.2 최종 버전 릴리스 후 5년까지 보안 업데이트(소스만)가 릴리스될 예정이며, 이는 2016년 2월로 계획되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:33.221373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "As of 2016-02-20, Python 3.2.x reached end-of-life status.",
      "source_hash": 13498191320406650759,
      "context_hash": 708430088710103080,
      "translation": "2016년 2월 20일 기준으로 Python 3.2.x는 수명 종료 상태에 도달했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:33.221374Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The final source release was 3.2.6 in October 2014.",
      "source_hash": 16728839648943667538,
      "context_hash": 1708777395171607916,
      "translation": "최종 소스 릴리스는 2014년 10월의 3.2.6이었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:33.221374Z",
      "issues": []
    },
